            ("p", "Restoration is not 'turn it back on'. It is: fix the cause, add the guard that would have caught it, verify on a replay of the incident inputs, and re-enable gradually with a watch. If the verification step is skipped, the same incident returns with a different date."),
            ("p", "Communication should be drafted by a human and reviewed by whoever owns legal and customer trust. Three audiences usually matter: affected customers, the regulator where the law requires notification, and your own team. Write plainly, state what you know and what you do not, and avoid explaining model behaviour you have not verified."),
